Error [E0172]: `Point` does not wrap into `Dyn` automatically
  --> dyn_no_auto_wrap.jet:10:18
    |
 10 |     row.origin = Point{x: 1, y: 2}
    |                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Only primitive data and recursively wrappable collections wrap automatically
 Fix: Write `Dyn.from(value)` (the type must implement `Encode`)
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0172
